
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Discover something beyond ordinary at 4low-mart.">
  <title>4LOW-MART | Less Ordinary</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background: #080808;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 22px 7%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #252525;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #aaa;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 18px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 75vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 20px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, #303030, #080808 65%);
    }

    .tag {
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: #aaa;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(55px, 12vw, 100px);
      line-height: .9;
      letter-spacing: -5px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #aaa;
      max-width: 350px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }

    .btn {
      background: white;
      color: black;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 15px 28px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 75px 7%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .muted {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid #333;
      padding: 35px 12px;
      background: #111;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .coming {
      margin-top: 65px;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      padding: 45px 15px;
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #292929;
      padding: 25px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    @media(max-width: 600px) {
      nav a {
        margin-left: 9px;
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: -3px;
      }

      footer {
        gap: 12px;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">4LOW-MART.</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">HOME</a>
    <a href="#shop">SHOP</a>
    <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="tag">THE NEW WAY TO DISCOVER</div>

    <h1>LESS<br>ORDINARY.</h1>

    <p>
      Discover thoughtfully selected products
      designed to make everyday life better.
    </p>

    <a href="#shop" class="btn">EXPLORE COLLECTION ↗</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="shop">
    <h2>Explore Categories</h2>
    <p class="muted">Something different is coming.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>TECH ESSENTIALS</h3>
        <p>Everyday technology</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>DESK & LIVING</h3>
        <p>Upgrade your space</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>DAILY ESSENTIALS</h3>
        <p>Made for everyday life</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="coming">
      <h2>COMING SOON.</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Our first collection is in development.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about">
    <h2>Less Ordinary. More You.</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      4low-mart is building a better way to discover
      useful and thoughtfully selected products.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <span>© 2026 4LOW-MART.</span>
  <span>LESS ORDINARY. MORE YOU.</span>
</footer>
<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
